Z||000052||DR650SE||11-27-2001||11:46 PM||||TIME=12 NOON<BR>DATE= THIS SATURDAY<BR>LOCATION=6000 E MAIN ST.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.corvetteforum.cc/zeroimg/smilies/cheers.gif">        <IMG SRC="http://www.corvetteforum.cc/zeroimg/smilies/coolgleamA.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://www.corvetteforum.cc/zeroimg/smilies/biggrinjester.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://www.corvetteforum.cc/zeroimg/smilies/iamwithstupid.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://www.corvetteforum.cc/zeroimg/smilies/reddevil.gif">      <IMG SRC="http://www.corvetteforum.cc/zeroimg/smilies/seeya.gif">   <P><BR>HERE ARE SOME DIRECTIONS THAT I COPIED FROM THE COLUMBUS GET TOGATHER POST<BR>very ez, not 1 stop lite at all. when he gets to 70 west, its about an hour & 15 mins till he gets to the east side of Columbus. after he passes Brice Rd exit, I-270 north is next exit to the right. the first exit on 270 north is Main St east to the right. as you come off the exit Hooters is rite beside you on the right. after you stop at the exit turn right into the right lane and then another right at first road, then immediately turn right into the driveway. I think the address is 6000 E main st. phone is (614) 755-9464.<P>------------------<BR>AIM:  DR650SE<BR>2 Black 86 SE's V-6 4-SPD<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/DR650SEsig2.gif">   <P><p>[This message has been edited by DR650SE (edited 11-28-2001).]||||reg||1
